WEBVTT

00:03.010 --> 00:05.620
<i><i>I worked as a salaryman
for a toxic company,</i></i>

00:05.620 --> 00:07.430
<i><i>until I reincarnated...</i></i>

00:07.430 --> 00:12.090
<i><i>in a crazy world where everything is
dropped by monsters in dungeons.</i></i>

00:12.530 --> 00:17.460
<i><i>In my new life, I'm level 1,
but I have a unique skill</i></i>

00:17.460 --> 00:19.690
<i><i>that puts all of my drop rates at rank S.</i></i>

00:19.990 --> 00:22.920
<i><i>And at last, I'm back in Secro!</i></i>

00:23.180 --> 00:25.620
<i><i>Wait, there's a stray showing up already?!</i></i>

00:25.930 --> 00:27.840
<i><i>And Eve, too?!</i></i>

00:36.140 --> 00:45.270
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

02:00.010 --> 02:05.020
<b>We've All Been Waiting!







It's Eve's Turn to Shine</b>

02:11.520 --> 02:12.850
No.

02:12.850 --> 02:14.510
Not delicious.

02:14.980 --> 02:18.270
I want those! I want to eat...

02:18.270 --> 02:20.520
the low-level's carrots!

02:22.000 --> 02:25.650
Come back soon, Low-Level...

02:26.530 --> 02:28.950
Welcome! Come on over!

02:28.220 --> 02:30.070
Yo, check it out!

02:30.070 --> 02:32.850
Oh, man! She's gorgeous!

02:34.780 --> 02:38.100
This is Secro. Pretty lively town, isn't it?

02:38.100 --> 02:38.930
It is.

02:41.300 --> 02:44.790
<i>Come to think of it,
I wonder what Eve's up to.</i>

02:44.790 --> 02:46.880
Oh? Is that you, Ryota?

02:47.180 --> 02:49.480
Erza! It's been so long!

02:49.480 --> 02:51.990
It has! So you're back now?

02:51.990 --> 02:52.620
Wait...

02:52.620 --> 02:55.420
Um... who is this?

02:55.420 --> 02:57.780
Oh, I'll introduce you.

02:57.780 --> 02:59.490
This is Celeste.

02:59.490 --> 03:03.080
We're going to form a party
called the Ryota Family.

03:04.050 --> 03:07.360
You're forming a party with
someone this beautiful?!

03:07.360 --> 03:09.350
Erza? What's wrong?

03:09.350 --> 03:11.440
N-Not a thing!

03:11.440 --> 03:15.020
I heard rumors about all the
great things you've done!

03:15.020 --> 03:18.490
I'm thrilled that one of my
regulars has become famous!

03:18.490 --> 03:22.660
A-Anyway, I wanted to ask you a favor
regarding the harvest festival!

03:22.660 --> 03:25.560
Please come by my shop
whenever you have time!

03:25.560 --> 03:27.210
W-Well, bye!

03:28.910 --> 03:31.010
Harvest festival?

03:31.010 --> 03:33.230
I don't know much about it, either.

03:33.230 --> 03:35.770
In that case, you can leave it all to me.

03:36.460 --> 03:40.580
Emily and I went out and got some
information about the harvest festival.

03:40.580 --> 03:42.780
Way to go, Celeste!

03:42.780 --> 03:47.260
It's a festival held annually in Secro.

03:47.260 --> 03:51.950
Goods found in Secro's dungeons are
gathered up and put on display.

03:51.950 --> 03:53.110
Okay.

03:53.110 --> 03:55.760
And what do they do with all those goods?

03:55.760 --> 03:57.390
Kill them!

03:57.390 --> 03:58.180
Eh?

03:58.180 --> 04:01.680
They turn them into strays
in an arena and kill them.

04:01.920 --> 04:06.470
The point is to show off both
the goods and the monsters.

04:06.980 --> 04:08.600
I see.

04:09.370 --> 04:12.520
So... what are we doing here, anyway?

04:12.520 --> 04:14.770
Oh, actually...

04:17.190 --> 04:23.110
<b>Nihonium Level 3</b>

04:17.810 --> 04:19.600
After I parted ways with you two,

04:19.600 --> 04:23.110
I wanted to get my speed up to 
rank S in a hurry, so I came here...

04:23.240 --> 04:25.780
m 0 0 l -42 0 l -46 -4 l -46 -28 l -42 -32 l -28 -32 l -28 -30 l -42 -30 l -44 -28 l -44 -4 l -42 -2 l 0 -2

04:23.240 --> 04:25.780
m 0 0 l -42 0 l -46 -4 l -46 -28 l -42 -32 l -28 -32 l -28 -30 l -42 -30 l -44 -28 l -44 -4 l -42 -2 l 0 -2

04:23.240 --> 04:25.780
Ryota's speed increased by 0.

04:23.440 --> 04:25.920
<i>Ryota's speed increased by 0.</i>

04:27.080 --> 04:29.040
But I maxed it out in no time.

04:29.030 --> 04:31.000
<b>Nihonium Level 4</b>

04:29.780 --> 04:32.770
I still had time, so I went down to level 4.

04:33.320 --> 04:35.420
I had some trouble at first,

04:35.420 --> 04:38.330
but I finally managed to
defeat the monsters there...

04:38.210 --> 04:41.130
m 0 0 l -42 0 l -46 -4 l -46 -28 l -42 -32 l -28 -32 l -28 -30 l -42 -30 l -44 -28 l -44 -4 l -42 -2 l 0 -2

04:38.210 --> 04:41.130
m 0 0 l -42 0 l -46 -4 l -46 -28 l -42 -32 l -28 -32 l -28 -30 l -42 -30 l -44 -28 l -44 -4 l -42 -2 l 0 -2

04:38.210 --> 04:41.130
Ryota's vitality increased by 1.

04:38.330 --> 04:41.140
<i>Ryota's vitality increased by 1.</i>

04:42.330 --> 04:46.460
I put the seeds I found there in that box.

04:46.460 --> 04:47.020
What?

04:47.020 --> 04:49.030
Isn't that a bad idea?

04:49.920 --> 04:51.290
Strays!

04:49.920 --> 04:51.290
Yes!

04:51.290 --> 04:52.440
Huh?!

04:53.100 --> 04:55.790
Celeste, everything's fine.

05:01.730 --> 05:04.310
<i>Ryota obtained binding bullets.</i>

05:04.310 --> 05:05.980
Binding bullets!

05:05.980 --> 05:09.000
That sounds like a fun one!

05:09.230 --> 05:10.960
And there you have it.

05:10.960 --> 05:14.130
I had no idea strays could drop things.

05:14.420 --> 05:17.780
I haven't told anyone else about this.

05:17.780 --> 05:20.030
So I'd like you to keep it quiet, too.

05:20.030 --> 05:23.340
Huh? If you're keeping
it secret, why tell me?

05:23.340 --> 05:25.660
Because you're one of us now.

05:30.990 --> 05:31.980
What was that?

05:34.740 --> 05:35.790
What the...

05:36.300 --> 05:37.530
What happened here?!

05:37.940 --> 05:40.600
A rare drop turned into a stray!

05:40.600 --> 05:42.530
You guys need to run, too!

05:57.750 --> 05:59.410
Emily! Celeste!

05:59.410 --> 06:00.390
Got it!

05:59.410 --> 06:00.390
Right!

06:03.440 --> 06:05.540
Burn! Inferno!

06:16.610 --> 06:17.630
Emily!

06:21.440 --> 06:23.640
It's... not even moving...

06:23.640 --> 06:24.660
That's it!

06:32.550 --> 06:35.420
Looks like you get to show your
stuff already, binding bullets!

06:47.810 --> 06:49.610
Time to finish this!

07:07.870 --> 07:10.050
Emily! Are you okay?

07:10.050 --> 07:10.820
Yes...

07:11.840 --> 07:15.660
I'm all right... but...

07:20.940 --> 07:23.770
All right! Let's buy you a new hammer!

07:23.770 --> 07:25.790
The best one out there!

07:25.790 --> 07:28.480
What?! But that would be wasted on me!

07:28.950 --> 07:31.810
If I just straighten it
out like this, I can...

07:35.750 --> 07:36.960
Emily...

07:37.710 --> 07:40.280
We'll go buy a new one tomorrow.

07:41.010 --> 07:42.450
Okay...

07:44.980 --> 07:46.650
Is that true?!

07:47.170 --> 07:52.150
Yeah... It was Sato who defeated the stray.

07:52.530 --> 07:53.610
Oh...

07:55.710 --> 07:56.660
Hi, there!

07:56.660 --> 07:59.870
I'm Smith, the weapons dealer.

07:59.870 --> 08:03.490
Um... What did you want with us?

08:03.730 --> 08:08.090
Well, I heard that Emily's hammer broke

08:08.090 --> 08:11.430
when your party was fighting
the stray yesterday.

08:11.650 --> 08:16.530
So I was hoping to offer you a new hammer.

08:16.530 --> 08:17.620
Offer one?

08:17.620 --> 08:18.340
Yes!

08:18.680 --> 08:22.520
The Ryota Family has drawn much 
attention for their exploits in Selen,

08:22.520 --> 08:26.150
and we supplied Emily, one of the members,
 with her beloved hammer!

08:26.150 --> 08:29.730
I want to lay claim to that slogan!

08:29.730 --> 08:32.650
What?! I don't think I want that!

08:32.650 --> 08:35.020
I promise you won't suffer for it.

08:35.020 --> 08:38.070
I'll provide you with the
hammer at no charge.

08:38.400 --> 08:39.140
Huh?

08:40.780 --> 08:42.500
For... free?

08:42.790 --> 08:45.170
Yes, for free!

08:46.310 --> 08:48.580
Then I can't wait to do business with you!

08:48.580 --> 08:50.690
Thank you very much!

08:50.690 --> 08:53.350
Now, let's get right to
the production process.

08:53.710 --> 08:56.730
If you have any requests
at all, just let me know.

08:56.730 --> 08:59.020
I-I can ask for anything?!

08:59.010 --> 09:01.930
<b>Nihonium Level 1</b>

08:59.020 --> 09:01.740
Oh! Mr. Sato!

09:02.230 --> 09:06.350
Hey, long time no see.
Working on air boxes again?

09:09.870 --> 09:11.270
Is something wrong?

09:11.840 --> 09:16.180
The thing is... air boxes haven't
been selling so well lately.

09:16.470 --> 09:20.900
It's not as though Princess Margaret
is any less popular...

09:20.900 --> 09:24.460
I guess people are tired of air boxes?

09:24.460 --> 09:27.340
Can't you just sell something else, then?

09:27.340 --> 09:30.250
Something else? Such as?

09:30.520 --> 09:32.430
Well...

09:36.520 --> 09:38.770
The princess's panties, maybe?

09:39.050 --> 09:42.020
Shall I lift it a bit more?

09:42.020 --> 09:44.060
That's it!

09:44.060 --> 09:46.190
What?! You know you can't actually do that!

09:48.570 --> 09:50.020
Rings?

09:51.970 --> 09:55.920
Rings would be right in line with
the princess's elegant image,

09:52.700 --> 09:56.380
Please accept this. 
It's the princess's... my own...

09:55.920 --> 09:57.240
and they would feel special.

09:57.240 --> 10:00.260
Are you a genius?!

10:03.460 --> 10:04.540
Princess!

10:05.860 --> 10:07.130
I've got this!

10:16.160 --> 10:17.200
Excuse me!

10:17.630 --> 10:21.890
Thank you for saving me
when I was in danger.

10:22.670 --> 10:26.320
Aw, c'mon. I just did what
anyone would've done.

10:26.320 --> 10:30.050
Mr. Sato, thank you for saving our princess.

10:30.440 --> 10:34.240
To thank you, since you
gave us the idea of rings,

10:34.240 --> 10:37.600
would you allow us to present
you with the first one?

10:37.600 --> 10:41.320
The first one? But I couldn't...

10:41.320 --> 10:42.660
Please!

10:42.940 --> 10:49.070
I want to give my first... to you, Mr. Sato.

10:49.690 --> 10:52.300
Huh? Uh...

10:53.360 --> 10:54.130
Okay...

10:55.210 --> 10:57.430
What do you think, Miss Emily?

10:57.820 --> 10:59.520
Well, let's see...

10:59.520 --> 11:02.550
I think I'd like it heavier and sturdier.

11:04.980 --> 11:07.610
Eve! Welcome!

11:08.690 --> 11:11.900
Carrots—I mean, where is the low-level?

11:11.900 --> 11:13.210
Low-level?

11:13.210 --> 11:16.310
If you mean Yoda, he's gone to Nihonium.

11:16.670 --> 11:21.350
He was going to stop by Telulu
and then Erza's shop after that.

11:21.350 --> 11:23.240
Nihonium first!

11:23.240 --> 11:24.480
Got it!

11:27.160 --> 11:30.080
<b>Telulu Level 1</b>

11:32.760 --> 11:35.910
This thing sure came in handy right away.

11:36.390 --> 11:41.110
<i>Ryota obtained a pouch that automatically
picks up and contains dropped items.</i>

11:42.100 --> 11:46.170
If I didn't have this, people would've
seen me getting these seeds.

11:46.790 --> 11:48.700
That would've been bad.

11:49.550 --> 11:52.650
Anyway, time to make a little money!

11:53.220 --> 11:54.190
Carrots...

11:53.230 --> 11:57.150
<b>Nihonium Level 1</b>

11:54.190 --> 11:56.380
Low-Level... Carrots...

11:57.140 --> 11:59.560
He's not here!

11:59.880 --> 12:01.890
Then... Telulu!

12:04.860 --> 12:06.790
U-Um...

12:06.790 --> 12:08.280
Eve?

12:10.150 --> 12:11.630
Low-Level...

12:11.630 --> 12:14.160
where are you?

12:17.660 --> 12:19.110
Here you go.

12:19.110 --> 12:21.000
All right, got it.

12:22.030 --> 12:25.480
Oh! Ryota, you're here!

12:25.480 --> 12:26.520
Yeah.

12:26.520 --> 12:31.140
So, what was the favor you wanted to
ask me for the harvest festival?

12:31.140 --> 12:32.210
Right!

12:32.210 --> 12:36.650
Wait, do you know what the
harvest festival actually is?

12:36.650 --> 12:38.090
Pretty much.

12:38.090 --> 12:40.530
You put products from dungeons on display,

12:40.530 --> 12:42.520
then turn them into strays
and kill them, right?

12:42.520 --> 12:45.470
If you know that much,
it'll save us some time.

12:45.470 --> 12:50.460
I'd like you to collect drops
that are difficult to get.

12:50.460 --> 12:53.870
I see. You mean rare drops, right?

12:53.870 --> 12:54.990
Yes!

12:54.990 --> 12:59.080
And I'll pay you for all of them.
Would you do that?

12:59.080 --> 13:01.460
Of course I will.

13:01.460 --> 13:04.020
You're always doing so
much for me, after all.

13:04.020 --> 13:05.910
Thank you so much!

13:05.910 --> 13:07.890
In that case, take this.

13:07.890 --> 13:11.050
It's a list of the rare drops 
we haven't found yet.

13:14.100 --> 13:17.090
So sorry to interrupt your fun.

13:17.090 --> 13:18.540
What fun?!

13:18.540 --> 13:21.850
Here's the 40,000 pilos for
the items you brought in.

13:21.850 --> 13:24.980
Huh? That's more small change than usual.

13:24.980 --> 13:26.970
Oh, sorry about that.

13:26.970 --> 13:31.880
The person in charge of the dungeon that
drops money was arrested for corruption.

13:31.880 --> 13:35.450
So money circulation is
lagging a bit at the moment.

13:35.450 --> 13:36.940
Huh...

13:37.780 --> 13:41.510
Wait, money is dropped in a dungeon?!

13:41.510 --> 13:44.500
Y-Yes, that's right.

13:45.760 --> 13:47.470
<i>Which means...</i>

13:50.360 --> 13:53.550
<i>I should get a stray from this!</i>

13:55.020 --> 14:00.020
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:55.020 --> 14:00.020
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

13:55.320 --> 13:58.120
Hey, director! Punch!

14:00.020 --> 14:05.030
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

14:00.020 --> 14:05.030
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

14:01.310 --> 14:05.020
Why am I doing the title call alone?
 It's not even my turn.

14:13.010 --> 14:14.310
It worked!

14:14.310 --> 14:16.920
Hey! Don't run away from me, ten grand!

14:29.340 --> 14:30.520
Got it!

14:32.740 --> 14:33.940
What's this?

14:34.300 --> 14:37.710
<i>Ryota obtained a potion that boosts one's 
plant drop rate by three ranks for ten minutes.</i>

14:41.350 --> 14:43.700
Ooh!

14:43.700 --> 14:47.620
Actually, this doesn't mean much to me,
since my drop rates are all at rank S...

14:47.620 --> 14:51.930
I found you!

14:53.830 --> 14:56.200
Low-Level!

14:57.750 --> 15:00.340
Carrots, please!

15:00.710 --> 15:01.590
Flop.

15:01.890 --> 15:02.770
Huh?

15:06.420 --> 15:09.840
<b>Telulu Level 2</b>

15:09.850 --> 15:14.100
If you want carrots that badly,
ask your partymates.

15:14.100 --> 15:15.550
Not good enough!

15:17.060 --> 15:19.960
Your carrots taste better!

15:19.960 --> 15:22.180
Also, I left them.

15:22.180 --> 15:24.170
What? Why?

15:25.430 --> 15:27.350
A difference in dungeonal direction.

15:27.350 --> 15:28.580
Were you a band?!

15:28.900 --> 15:33.720
I'm a rabbit who just wants carrots,
and they want other stuff.

15:33.720 --> 15:36.210
It happens all the time.

15:36.210 --> 15:38.410
All the time? Really?

15:38.730 --> 15:40.390
Rabbits are strong!

15:40.390 --> 15:42.140
I'm fine by myself!

15:43.130 --> 15:44.840
Rabbits know...

15:44.840 --> 15:47.040
that partymates are a hassle.

15:47.040 --> 15:48.330
Not good.

15:50.470 --> 15:53.890
<b>Mangan Level 16</b>

15:55.500 --> 15:57.480
Come on, Eve!

15:57.770 --> 16:00.270
Don't just eat meat.
 Eat some vegetables, too.

16:00.270 --> 16:01.110
No!

16:01.890 --> 16:04.530
I hate vegetables! Yucky!

16:04.530 --> 16:05.820
I like meat!

16:06.200 --> 16:08.210
You need to eat them anyway!

16:08.210 --> 16:09.730
No!

16:16.770 --> 16:20.260
Party members are annoying. I hate them.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.390
Huh?

16:31.690 --> 16:35.060
It talked! What an unusual carrot!

16:35.540 --> 16:38.610
Is this... a haunted house?

16:39.380 --> 16:42.020
Not a carrot. You're a human?

16:42.410 --> 16:44.200
Are you a ghost?

16:51.550 --> 16:53.450
A cow ghost?!

16:53.450 --> 16:56.530
No. It's a death buffalo.

16:56.530 --> 16:58.690
It's this floor's monster.

16:58.690 --> 16:59.940
Monster?!

17:03.920 --> 17:05.350
Stay still!

17:18.050 --> 17:19.180
Hmph!

17:19.520 --> 17:20.920
Wow!

17:23.040 --> 17:24.980
How did you do that?

17:24.980 --> 17:26.800
Can I do it, too?

17:26.800 --> 17:27.970
Huh?

17:27.970 --> 17:30.560
I wanna exterminate ghosts, too!

17:30.560 --> 17:32.550
Come on! Teach me how!

17:32.550 --> 17:34.490
Please teach me!

17:34.490 --> 17:36.400
O-Okay...

17:51.690 --> 17:53.220
Now! Throw!

17:53.220 --> 17:54.160
Right!

18:09.510 --> 18:11.180
It turned into a carrot!

18:11.180 --> 18:12.320
Throw it away.

18:12.320 --> 18:14.190
Huh? Why?

18:14.190 --> 18:16.740
I hate carrots. Yucky.

18:17.230 --> 18:19.570
You shouldn't be picky about food.

18:19.570 --> 18:21.970
I don't care! I hate—

18:20.090 --> 18:22.040
Let's split it in half, then.

18:22.400 --> 18:23.650
Rabbits—

18:22.740 --> 18:24.490
Here. It's yummy.

18:35.750 --> 18:37.840
Want this, too? You can have it.

18:38.400 --> 18:39.140
Here.

18:39.500 --> 18:42.480
You're good! We're a party!

18:42.480 --> 18:45.330
Yeah! We're a party!

18:45.900 --> 18:46.900
Huh?

18:58.690 --> 19:00.220
Where have you been?!

19:00.220 --> 19:01.840
We were so worried!

19:01.840 --> 19:06.570
Hey, listen to this! I defeated a big cow!

19:07.440 --> 19:08.870
And then...

19:10.920 --> 19:17.550
From then on, I was a carrot-loving rabbit
who sought out delicious carrots.

19:17.550 --> 19:21.550
All because of that boy... my partymate.

19:21.550 --> 19:23.940
Which means parties are bad.

19:24.630 --> 19:27.480
I think you're just being a bit too extreme.

19:27.950 --> 19:32.410
Anyway, if you love carrots that much,
 you should get your own.

19:33.120 --> 19:36.780
I can't. My plant drop rate is D.

19:36.780 --> 19:39.770
I only get yucky carrots.

19:39.770 --> 19:41.040
Oh...

19:41.040 --> 19:43.820
Hey, I've got just the thing for you, then.

19:43.820 --> 19:45.340
You do?

19:47.580 --> 19:49.220
It's not a carrot.

19:49.220 --> 19:51.630
Don't worry about that. Just drink it.

20:01.230 --> 20:02.740
Is this real?!

20:02.740 --> 20:06.150
Yeah. If your plant drop rate is D,

20:06.150 --> 20:08.790
it should've just gone up by three to A.

20:08.790 --> 20:10.240
Give it a try.

20:21.870 --> 20:23.310
Now taste it.

20:30.080 --> 20:32.510
The sweetness! The crunch!

20:32.510 --> 20:35.190
It's definitely an A-rank carrot!

20:35.190 --> 20:38.370
Plus, the sense of accomplishment
in knowing I got it myself!

20:38.370 --> 20:41.620
This is... truly delicious!

20:41.920 --> 20:44.630
Where do they sell this potion?!

20:44.630 --> 20:47.070
Uh... sorry.

20:47.510 --> 20:49.210
Nobody sells it.

20:49.480 --> 20:53.680
In fact... it's a special
item that only I can get.

21:00.600 --> 21:01.950
Low-Level!

21:01.950 --> 21:02.750
Huh?

21:03.160 --> 21:05.450
Let me join your party!

21:05.450 --> 21:07.400
What?! Just like that?!

21:07.770 --> 21:10.660
You said partymates were bad!

21:10.660 --> 21:12.840
I was wrong!

21:12.840 --> 21:14.900
Partymates are good!

21:14.900 --> 21:18.850
They give me potions,
and they give me tasty carrots!

21:18.850 --> 21:21.300
Partymates didn't do that! <i>I</i> did!

21:21.620 --> 21:24.200
Please! I'll do anything!

21:24.540 --> 21:25.540
Please!

21:25.540 --> 21:30.230
Please! Please! Please!

21:26.200 --> 21:30.230
Okay, okay! You can join!
You can join my party!

21:31.280 --> 21:34.710
Low-Level! I love you!

21:39.190 --> 21:40.980
I'm back...

21:41.550 --> 21:44.300
Yoda, look at this!

21:44.300 --> 21:47.900
My new hammer is all... done?

21:48.400 --> 21:51.900
Um... what has happened, exactly?

21:52.540 --> 21:53.890
Well...

21:54.380 --> 21:59.220
This is Eve, and she'll be
joining the Ryota Family.

21:59.220 --> 22:02.850
Yay! Welcome to our party!

22:03.350 --> 22:08.140
Low-Level! I love you, love you, <i>love</i> you!
